<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Costello plans briefing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Costello plans briefing.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a news conference at 12.30 p.m. (0130 GMT) to discuss the government's policy on concessional infrastructure borrowings, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
